      "opacity": 100,
      "originalText": "Live traffic never runs an invalid config: an invalid file is never applied (step 2), and an applied-but-broken one is reverted in\nunder a second (step 4). New team routes use HAProxy's Runtime API (add map) - instant, no reload at all.",
      "roughness": 1,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1720360206,
      "strokeColor": "#5c3c00",
